      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Yehoshafati iri gwaá', kuri foól dír /aantuudaá baabi'iiwós kay foól kudaá baraá gixsár Daudi. Garmaawós Yehoramu kitaangós gway óh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoramu garmoó waawutmo Yehoshafati oo Yuda hhae ngi kon a lahhoó', an ín Asariya, nee Yehieli, nee Sekaria, nee Asariya, nee Mikaeli nee Shefatia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baabuúín gina qeemuú úr i haniís oo peésa, nee sahaábu, nee muruú hatlá' oo hhohhó', nee gixsadaá taa koo/ír gawídí tleéhh awa Yuda. Ala waawuti'iima gana haniís dír Yehoramu asma tawa garmoó baris. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár Yehoramu iwa iwiít gawaá kitángw waawuti'iima oo baabuúwós, nee waawuti'iimarós iwa gawduúr, hhaeewós sleémeero gina tsuú/, nee geeraharuusér Israeli bahh'ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoramu waawuti'iima ngiwa iimu/ún kureeriiwós a mibeeri tám nee tsár. Ina Yerusalemúr wa waawuti'ín kureeri dakaát. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós loohidá' tlaakw ar Ahabu waawutmo Israeli gana eehár, asma hareerós a dasír waawutmo Ahabu. Inós tlakweema gina tleéhh dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe AAKOÓ MUNGÚ doó Daudi nguwa qwaareesi gwa slaiiká, asma alqadoodá' aa oó' dír Daudi xwaylarós iwa waawuti'iin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár waawuti'iimár Yehoramuwo múk Edomu sawaawuti'iimár múk Yuda gana sií', nee waawutmooín ngway tsawaariyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, Yehoramu nee geeraharuuseerós nee garduuwós sleémeero tari xweeraá haratláy amór múk Edomu, qoomaarihe múk Edomu Yehoramu nee slaqwaruuseerós sleémeero nee garduuwose kinga harweér. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe múk Edomu tam ay laarí kiwa sawaawuti'in nee múk Yuda ngaa si'iyé'. Qoomaarír kilae sleeme múk Libna waawuti'iimár Yehoramu ngina si'iyé', asma Yehoramu AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguú baabi'iiwós guna sií'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinkwa nee tihe inós wa/angwduú gawaá gongoama' kudá' munguaá hatlá' kiwa sluufmiisi guna tleéhh gawaá tlom'aá Yuda, múk Yerusalemu guri inkihhimu wasleerár áy, nee múk Yuda guri qwaareés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aarusmo Eliya barwito'o gari gooín dír waawutmo Yehoramu iwa kaahi, «AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú baabuúwók Daudi, i kaahi, ‹Asma kuúng loohír baabuúwók Yehoshafati aga eehatká, laqaá loohír Asa waawutmoó Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuúng ana hót adór waawituú Israeli ira hoót, múk Yuda nee oo Yerusalemu kuri inkihhimu waslés ar adoodá' doó Ahabu múk Israeli ngura inkihhimu wasleés. Slám kuúng hhaeewók, na/aá baabuúwók oo kilá' ina tsú/, slám inooín kin ak hho' ta kunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ga/aaweek, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ mukók gu ló'wa muux, nee na/iiwoge nee tlaawaywoge nee daqaari'iimaroge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee kuúng tiqtír tlakw ar gura' un ót, slam umuú looár tlawa un albuhhaabúhh ay dír waqát sleémeero i tsee/áy faakisi.› » ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, múk Filisti nee oo Ma/araábu nee oo Kushi guri tleés as tawa slaqwi nee waawutmo Yehoramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín yaamaá Yuda kiri i haratláy, daqaari'iimár Yehoramu kay hayóh, nee daaqaywose nee tlaawaywose kiri ar tláy, aqo har garmaawós kuduú aluutmo ta bay Ahasia kuna geexáy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá tihe, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ guna slaáhh ar tiqtír gura' ar maasoó koomaaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiqtidá' ina kumaamít ay kureeri tsár, waqatuuwós nay tsee/ií ti'iít as tiqtidá', inós iri gwaá' ar waahare. Mukós asla gaa oohisiiká ar kuwa ilaiwawa/i ar adoodá' baabi'iiwós kira ásltí oohimiís.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
